      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹14.62 (up from ₹8.84 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹38.8b (up 13% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.60b (up 66% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.1% (up from 2.8% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 2.8%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 28%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 33% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 17% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
